#~ msgid ""
#~ "Adds the pre-contractual information that Directive (EU) 2024/825 "
#~ "requires from 27 September 2026. When enabled, the product page carries a "
#~ "reminder that the statutory guarantee of conformity applies, and each "
#~ "product gains fields for a commercial guarantee of durability, the period "
#~ "of free software updates for goods with digital elements, and repair "
#~ "information. The harmonised label artwork for the durability guarantee "
#~ "comes from a separate implementing act, so this module renders plain "
#~ "labelled rows."
#~ msgstr ""
